You can start teleporting with ^T as soon as you have reached a high enough
level. I think you have to be around level 12 for that. Till then you have to
rely on the random effects of intrinsic teleport.

The funny message is a replacement for the usual "Your sacrifice is consumed in a
burst of flames". But it's still good for a laugh when you encounter it the first
time.

